-- 142: SAMPLE-SELECTION SCENE — euclid + `n`, real claps, 80s pop on top.
-- Two ideas drive the rhythm section:
--   1. euclidean rhythm: `s "bd(3,8)"` is E(3,8) — 3 hits spread over 8 steps.
--      Rotations/other densities: cp(3,8,2), realclaps(5,16), hand(7,16).
--   2. sample selection / modulation with `n`: for a sample, `n` picks WHICH
--      file in the folder (bd:0, bd:1, …) and can be modulated over time:
--        n (slow 4 $ choose [0,1,2])    new kick sample every 4 cycles
--        n (choose [0,1,2,3])           pick per hit
--        speed (slow 3 $ range 1 1.4 sine)   playback-rate sweep
-- Claps: WAY more real claps. The bank has realclaps (4), ovenclaps (11),
--   hand (17), cp (2) — note `n` only varies a folder that has more than one
--   file, so realclaps/n is real sample selection, not just pitch.
-- 80s pop on top (loud, dry — it kept getting buried):
--   d7 melody — Toto, "Africa" (1982) chorus, tabs-tidal/Toto_-_Africa.gp3-*.tidal,
--     8-bar A-major arc (statement / rise fs5 / high gs5 / return). gain 1.15..1.4.
--   d8 arpeggio — Tears For Fears, "Everybody Wants To Rule The World" (1985),
--     indexed riff d5 fs5 a5 fs5 b5 fs5 a5 fs5.
--   Both in F#m / A major (a b cs e fs gs) — in key with the fs1 bass.
-- Bass (d5): dubsynth pulled DOWN to gain 0.5 — it was too strong.
-- Mix: kick/bass dry (drums+bass group aux sends 0 in sc/routing.scd) — the
--   fix for the reverb-on-the-kick that kept reappearing.
-- Bass/kick tightened for space: shorter envelopes (release 0.09 kick, sustain
--   0.06 + lpf 900 bass), kick hpf 42 and gain down to 0.95, bass gain 0.32.
--   Group bus trims at runtime: drums 0.9, bass 0.8, music 1.25
--   (~groupCtl.set(gain, sDel, sVerb, sShim) in sclang).
-- Melody slowed 2-fold (slow 4, gain ramp over 32 cycles); a SLOW PAD chord
--   progression (d9, vi-IV-I-V in F#m, slow 4, attack 0.4 / release 1.6) sits
--   underneath to fill the space the trimmed kick/bass left.
-- Folders: 773 total in the sound library; this scene uses 808bd, realclaps,
--   cp, ovenclaps, hand, hh + project dubsynth/hoRhodes.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ s "808bd(3,8)" # n (slow 4 $ choose [0,1,2]) # gain 0.95 # shape 0.55 # hpf 42 # release 0.09 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d2 $ s "realclaps(5,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.9 # hpf 420 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d3 $ s "~ [cp cp] ~ [realclaps realclaps]" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.85 # hpf 420 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d4 $ s "ovenclaps(5,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.45 # hpf 750 # pan 0.62 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d5 $ note "fs1*16" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.5 # cutoff 160 # fenv 1.0 # drive 0.7 # sustain 0.06 # release 0.1 # lpf 900 # gain 0.32 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d6 $ s "hand(7,16)" # n (choose [0,1,2,3]) # gain 0.35 # speed (slow 3 $ range 1 1.4 sine) # pan 0.4 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d7 $ slow 4 $ note "<[b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 a4 ~] [cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 a4 b4 cs5 e5 b4 cs5 b4 ~] [e5 fs5 gs5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 ~] [b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain (slow 32 $ range 1.15 1.4 saw) # cutoff 4400 # release 0.7 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d8 $ note "d5 fs5 a5 fs5 b5 fs5 a5 fs5" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.7 # cutoff 3800 # release 0.25 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d9 $ slow 4 $ n "<[fs3,a3,cs4] [d3,fs3,a3] [a2,cs3,e3] [e3,gs3,b3]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.5 # cutoff 2200 # attack 0.4 # release 1.6 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d10 $ silence

d11 $ silence

d12 $ silence
